+// Attention window of the context's KV cache (0 = off, the default): each token attends only to the cells of the last
+// n_win positions, itself included, and the attention reads only the 256-cell blocks that hold them. For the MTP draft
+// context, whose single layer otherwise attends over the whole context in every draft pass. Returns false if the
+// context's memory is not a plain KV cache.
+LLAMA_API bool llama_set_attn_window(struct llama_context * ctx, uint32_t n_win);
+
 // Marks the entries that a joint decision head (clef) reads, the default is 0
 // See https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/29831 for details
 // A run of entries with the same value is one span, spans must be separated by entries with value 0
